{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由Yak &amp; Co開發的冒險解謎遊戲Down in Bermuda現正在Epic Games平台 限時免費 ，香港時間9月3日23:00截止。玩家將扮演飛行員Milton，在充滿神秘色彩的百慕大群島展開一場結合解謎與逃脫的奇幻旅程。</p><p>遊戲中，Milton因一場異常風暴被困在百慕大的時間泡泡內長達數十年。玩家需要破解密碼、解開謎題、收集魔法球，逐一逃離六座風格迥異的島嶼，並尋找回家的方法。本作由曾推出特務解謎遊戲Agent A: A puzzle in disguise的工作室製作，延續了精緻的關卡設計與輕鬆詼諧的敘事風格，適合喜愛解謎冒險的玩家。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fb116d2cfbdf24264cf7191af9376efb39ddaf04216dbfa47de452fe4742becd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F8c4c4d1f710e8419903c49af53f52201.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ac967c19274729074f939925459a616d17c50e6fdf62670199fb8a6035396c20/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F94803e234da198059fb842f19ad263b9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/aa54cb82147caabdcc9ab0c5ad8273f5ec3549227d33773238f45c499d0939f3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F9804569da81f9c633ea95a4a3087edf0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/349271c49edfddbab8a15ffa1e40ad93df1a718ef0eb6a09424ad5f9de95aa70/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F33c4b502bba0be23f768b41c06669888.jpg\"/><p>遊戲名稱：Down in Bermuda 支援平台：Android 領取位置： Epic Games</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T00:40:07.509465+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":4,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}